weren't the killer's actual targets.

559
00:48:32,960 --> 00:48:34,100
I’m not afraid of you.

560
00:48:36,320 --> 00:48:37,860
What are you doing this for, huh?

561
00:48:48,000 --> 00:48:49,100
To take your soul.

562
00:49:42,480 --> 00:49:43,340
You.

563
00:49:43,380 --> 00:49:45,620
You really are no match for me.

564
00:49:48,360 --> 00:49:50,580
How about it?
Want to be my house - bound spirit?

565
00:49:51,400 --> 00:49:52,260
Coming?

566
00:49:55,880 --> 00:49:57,060
Who sent you?

567
00:50:11,840 --> 00:50:12,980
Who sent you?

568
00:50:23,640 --> 00:50:24,940
Alright! I'll tell you!

569
00:50:25,080 --> 00:50:25,820
I’m telling!

570
00:50:26,320 --> 00:50:27,060
Arnon.

571
00:50:27,400 --> 00:50:28,340
Arnon.
